From: 林博仁(Buo-ren Lin) <buo.ren.lin@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 23:40:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Fix Vulkan vk::Buffer streaming on 32-bit targets

On 32-bit platforms, Vulkan non-dispatchable handles such as VkBuffer are
represented as uint64_t, and Vulkan-Hpp disables implicit conversions
for type safety.

Upstream commit 69fcec3bf11e54825edda9ea2c11e33f5cb9652c added an
operator<< overload for vk::Buffer in an anonymous namespace inside
ggml-vulkan.cpp. However, when ggml-vulkan was modularized in commit
fbdbbc7847e030166531e3b3edf30faac2e693a4 ("vulkan: split buffers and
debug code into separate files, add shared headers"), memory logging
calls using VK_LOG_MEMORY were moved to ggml-vulkan-debug.cpp, which
does not see the operator<< defined in ggml-vulkan.cpp.

Move the operator<< overload into ggml-vulkan-types.h so that all
translation units including ggml-vulkan-debug.cpp can stream vk::Buffer
handles properly.

Bug: https://github.com/ggml-org/whisper.cpp/issues/4036
Forwarded: not-needed
---
 ggml/src/ggml-vulkan/ggml-vulkan-types.h | 8 ++++++++
 ggml/src/ggml-vulkan/ggml-vulkan.cpp       | 5 -----
 2 files changed, 8 insertions(+), 5 deletions(-)

diff --git a/ggml/src/ggml-vulkan/ggml-vulkan-types.h b/ggml/src/ggml-vulkan/ggml-vulkan-types.h
index 4158ff77..aef6a0e4 100644
--- a/ggml/src/ggml-vulkan/ggml-vulkan-types.h
+++ b/ggml/src/ggml-vulkan/ggml-vulkan-types.h
@@ -25,6 +25,14 @@ DispatchLoaderDynamic & ggml_vk_default_dispatcher();
 
 #include <vulkan/vulkan.hpp>
 
+// On 32-bit platforms, Vulkan non-dispatchable handles such as VkBuffer are represented as uint64_t,
+// and Vulkan-Hpp disables implicit conversions for type safety.
+namespace {
+inline std::ostream & operator<<(std::ostream & os, vk::Buffer buffer) {
+    return os << static_cast<VkBuffer>(buffer);
+}
+}
+
 #ifndef VK_NV_cooperative_matrix_decode_vector
 #define VK_NV_cooperative_matrix_decode_vector 1
 #define VK_NV_COOPERATIVE_MATRIX_DECODE_VECTOR_EXTENSION_NAME "VK_NV_cooperative_matrix_decode_vector"
diff --git a/ggml/src/ggml-vulkan/ggml-vulkan.cpp b/ggml/src/ggml-vulkan/ggml-vulkan.cpp
index 5587dfc2..cdf3b445 100644
--- a/ggml/src/ggml-vulkan/ggml-vulkan.cpp
+++ b/ggml/src/ggml-vulkan/ggml-vulkan.cpp
@@ -1,10 +1,5 @@
 #include "ggml-vulkan-common.h"
 
-namespace {
-inline std::ostream & operator<<(std::ostream & os, vk::Buffer buffer) {
-    return os << static_cast<VkBuffer>(buffer);
-}
-}
 static vk_device_architecture get_device_architecture(const vk::PhysicalDevice& device) {
     vk::PhysicalDeviceProperties props = device.getProperties();
 
